<title>UK: Freddie Mac sets 62.5 mln stg three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac sets 62.5 mln stg three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Merrill Lynch International Ltd and Kokusai Europe.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERAL HOME LOAN MORTGAGE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    62.5 MLN STG  COUPON     6.40	MATURITY    17.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    17.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS US/GB/JP</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
